  "description": "An authentication bypass vulnerability exists in the OAuth2 TokenIntrospectionService in Apache CXF.\u00a0Due to a missing 'throw' keyword in the security context check, the introspection endpoint (/services/oauth2/introspect) can be accessed by any unauthenticated network attacker. However note that this is a safeguard only in the case that someone forgot to enable authentication on the service.\u00a0Users are recommended to upgrade to version 4.2.2 or 4.1.7 or 3.6.12, which fixes this issue.",
